==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Area Attackers with a side of Meatshields can easily deal with this stage.

